      "definition": "Comparable company-operated store and all e-commerce net revenue. Comparable company-operated stores must have been open, or open after significant expansion, for at least 12 full fiscal months. Excludes new/expanded stores under 12 months, temporarily relocated/closed stores, closed stores, and channels other than company-operated stores and e-commerce. The 53rd week is excluded from comparable sales.",
